<title>USA: Uranium disclaims FY96 $0.44 EPS forecast.</title>
<headline>Uranium disclaims FY96 $0.44 EPS forecast.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uranium Resources Inc Friday said it knows of no basis for a September 2 story in Barron's projecting that the company would have earnings per share of $0.44 in 1996.</p>
<p>While the company expects positive earnings for 1996, it &quot;does not anticipate under any set of reasonable assumptions that earnings per share would equal $0.44 this year,&quot; company Chairman and President Paul Willmott said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
